  <p id="c-zizhitongjian-144-chulingqu-and-song:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">己巳，<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-144-chulingqu-and-song:p001:m0003" ref="fo7_f8v_rmf">蕭衍</persName>以<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-144-chulingqu-and-song:p001:m0006" ref="m9u_v4i_tk5">宣德太后</persName>令追廢<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-144-chulingqu-and-song:p001:m0013" ref="w4m_9tw_147_A">涪陵王</persName>為<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-144-chulingqu-and-song:p001:m0017" ref="w4m_9tw_147_A">東昏侯</persName>，<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-144-chulingqu-and-song:p001:m0021" ref="6fs_tis_zoa_AA">褚后</persName>及太子<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-144-chulingqu-and-song:p001:m0026" ref="w4m_9tw_147_AA">誦</persName>並為庶人。</p>
</text>
